               MOVE EIBCALEN TO WS-CALEN.
               SET WS-ADDR-COMMAREA TO ADDRESS OF DFHCOMMAREA.
               PERFORM CALL-ZCP00EAB-002.
               PERFORM CALL-ZCP00KVI-003.
               PERFORM CALL-ZCU00FS7-004.
               PERFORM CALL-ZCP009IF-005.
               PERFORM EXPAND-ROOF-TYPE-0001.
               PERFORM DERIVE-EXCESS-0002.
               PERFORM REFRESH-REG-NUMBER-0003.
               PERFORM DERIVE-REG-NUMBER-0004.
               PERFORM REFRESH-BROKER-ID-0005.
               PERFORM COMPUTE-TERM-0006.
               PERFORM SEND-RECEIVE-MAP-0007.
               PERFORM APPLY-HOUSE-TYPE-0008.
               PERFORM RESOLVE-STATUS-CODE-0009.
               PERFORM COMPUTE-PREMIUM-0010.
               PERFORM APPLY-MANAGED-FUND-0011.
               PERFORM RECONCILE-NCD-YEARS-0012.
               PERFORM VALIDATE-EXCESS-0013.
               PERFORM SEND-RECEIVE-MAP-0014.
               EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
